comments.body:
@simondeziel thanks 1.3 is very reasonable to expect these days but Okta is [moving quite slowly](https://support.okta.com/help/s/article/does-okta-support-tls-1-3?language=en_US) on this. 

Preference is for the 6.x series with the newer feature set.

I have a hackey, per LXD instance work around of setting up nginx+host file+self-signed cert to the get the connection work. 

@tomponline thanks, I will keep this in mind. 

I should say auth0 works as documented and is owned by Okta, we might end up using that + user auth from Okta.
